+    /// The shifted two-group, two-row kernel: [`group2_x2_merged`] when both rows and both groups
+    /// stay within [`MERGED_SPREAD`] (`merged` holds both rows' [`row_merged`] operands), else
+    /// [`group2_x2`]. Both return the same `i64` lane sums.
